{"3734680": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "我只是想让她们都幸福", "steam_appid": 3734680, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you had the superpower of infinite respawns/time travel...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What would YOU use it for?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Foresee the future, and save the world?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All-in lottery, and get rich overnight?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use this power…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To date SIX girlfriends at the same time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have what it takes to be a perfect playboy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you've also stepped into the trap of fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bad choice could lead you to death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luckily, your power is able to rewind time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death seems meaning nothing to you:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Never the end, but a brand new beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But as time reverse and reset again and again,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gate of fate quietly shifts...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The price  may be far more than you can imagine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you regret after bloody endings?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or keep relying on your superpower,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maintaining the dangerous balance of keeping six relationships afloat?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a romance game, yet it's not just a romance game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're a playboy, yet you're more than just a playboy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are dozens of endings, yet only one true ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a story of harem, yet it's also a story of pure love.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>El Psy Kongroo (It's all the choice of the Steins;Gate)</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Main Character]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yanyan</strong>: your childhood girlfreind, the Venus of your high school, who  had shed countless tears for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734680/extras/beef271566aab7f568395d8c1e19d165.poster.avif?t=1780975132\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734680/extras/beef271566aab7f568395d8c1e19d165.webm?t=1780975132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734680/extras/beef271566aab7f568395d8c1e19d165.mp4?t=1780975132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chuchu</strong>: Your &quot;little child bride&quot;, a treasure comes from poor mountain village, the gentlest female in the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734680/extras/53400b52dd4e3c8b0209c6e1468898b6.poster.avif?t=1780975132\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734680/extras/53400b52dd4e3c8b0209c6e1468898b6.webm?t=1780975132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734680/extras/53400b52dd4e3c8b0209c6e1468898b6.mp4?t=1780975132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ruri Hakushiro</strong>: The heiress of a powerful Japanese conglomerate, yet her soul outshines even her noble birth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734680/extras/ff45a98eff5d8d638ded129c42dbbca1.poster.avif?t=1780975132\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734680/extras/ff45a98eff5d8d638ded129c42dbbca1.webm?t=1780975132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734680/extras/ff45a98eff5d8d638ded129c42dbbca1.mp4?t=1780975132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Qingyu:</strong> The elder twin sister, a surgeon by profession, who seems to be a good girl usually...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734680/extras/45fefebc07757af9475772c88efcf761.poster.avif?t=1780975132\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734680/extras/45fefebc07757af9475772c88efcf761.webm?t=1780975132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734680/extras/45fefebc07757af9475772c88efcf761.mp4?t=1780975132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bingyu</strong>: The younger twin sister, a game streamer by profession, skilled in voice acting and cosplay—your sexy little enchantress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734680/extras/5c92747298b28611f5c38cc235bc94e7.poster.avif?t=1780975132\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734680/extras/5c92747298b28611f5c38cc235bc94e7.webm?t=1780975132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734680/extras/5c92747298b28611f5c38cc235bc94e7.mp4?t=1780975132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Luoxi</strong>: A movie star, the queen  before millions of her fans—but with you, she’s just a lovestruck little woman.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734680/extras/b7d72f1d4a957d0d82cb89e602cd2cb4.poster.avif?t=1780975132\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734680/extras/b7d72f1d4a957d0d82cb89e602cd2cb4.webm?t=1780975132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734680/extras/b7d72f1d4a957d0d82cb89e602cd2cb4.mp4?t=1780975132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【Game Features】</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-Person Interactive | Deeply Immersive Simulation Experience</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the world of this game, you're not playing as a character with a certain name—your girls won’t call you by a name that isn’t yours. Believe it—YOU, the one in front of screen, is the protagonist definitely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you’d like, you can tap on the blank WhatsApp profile picture to upload your own. You can also turn off the protagonist’s voice, read the subtitles, and speak to them yourself—truly, madly, deeply.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Love and be brave! Just as if these girls were right there beside you.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Well-Designed Branching Storyline | Unique Time-Rewind System</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive stories certainly come with countless branching choices. Choices are essential for immersive interactive experience, yet they can also be a stress for many players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you don’t have to bother which choice is the “right” one: <br>In the case of infinite respawns, death is just so so—It's part of the story we want you to experience. No big deal—take a leap of faith!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also, no need to worry about making wrong choice and messing up “affection meter”—Your girls love you with all heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hint: The storyline tree in this game is not just a video playback selection place. After death, it’s a higher-dimensional space where you can choose the time point to return to in the PAST—Remember that you can rewind time, but you can‘’t jump  to the future or a parallel timeline  to the present.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Professionally Crafted Screenplay | Twists and Turns</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you’re a seasoned player who enjoys erotic elements, congratulations—This story is made for you! You’ll get the most complete experience! XD</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you’re a movie fan who values a compelling narrative, welcome—Here you’ll find a well-structured five-act drama, highlighted character arcs, and a climactic ending full of surprises… You’ll feel it was worth the price of admission. Please experience the unique charm of a perfect fusion of film and gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let’s traverse the narrow cliffside paths, manage the schedule of playboy, return to the very beginning, cross the abyss of bloody endings, and turn the gears of fate…</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maximized Use of PC Peripherals | Ingenious Interactive Mechanics</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, this game does have some QTE—not to test your reflexes, but to simulate the protagonist’s physical reactions using just keyboard and mouse in the absence of motion-sensing devices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And don’t worry if you fail any QTE—we’ve also crafted interesting storylines for QTE failure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you have a microphone, you’ll get an even more immersive experience—Multiple voice-controlled mechanics,  speak up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game supports 4K resolution settings, with HD video assets encoded at 20,000 kbps. Please ensure you have enough disk space before downloading.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That's all. <i>Starting Life in Another World </i>as a playboy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you had the superpower of infinite respawns/time travel...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What would YOU use it for?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Foresee the future, and save the world?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All-in lottery, and get rich overnight?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use this power…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To date SIX girlfriends at the same time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have what it takes to be a perfect playboy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you've also stepped into the trap of fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bad choice could lead you to death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luckily, your power is able to rewind time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death seems meaning nothing to you:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Never the end, but a brand new beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But as time reverse and reset again and again,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gate of fate quietly shifts...</p><p class=\"bb_pa